; the denominator variable of a derivative — with-respect-to
; sthira-apeksha: fixed reference (time, world-frame)
; chala-apeksha: moving reference (joint frames in kinematic chain)

(sangati apeksha
  (yukta viveka sankhya sambandha)
  (sthita kramanusara)
  (janya matra)
  (abheda sthira-apeksha chala-apeksha)
  (pratipaksha independence))
